00:03:40.776 --> 00:03:43.415
<v Host>It means officially, or formally.

00:03:44.015 --> 00:03:55.776
<v Slow>国民栄誉賞は、多くの国民に夢や希望を与えた人に、国から贈られる特別な賞です。

00:03:56.575 --> 00:04:03.824
<v Host>The People's Honor Award is a special prize from the state, given to people who brought dreams and hope to the nation.

