00:12:02.456 --> 00:12:25.015
<v Host>That's all for today. On July twenty-second, the government officially decided to give the People's Honor Award to speed skater Miho Takagi, who won ten Olympic medals — the most ever for a Japanese female athlete — before retiring this year. The ceremony is planned for July twenty-eighth. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

